Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
###
POST {{BASE_URL}}/arquivos/logo
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----BeautyCoreBoundary

------BeautyCoreBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="logo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./teste/logo.png
------BeautyCoreBoundary--


